<InfoPage title="Privacy Policy" kicker="Privacy" description="How Dreemy AI Guide handles visits and personal information on this static independent publication."><h2>Summary</h2><p>This is a static editorial website. It has no user accounts, character chats, prompt box, image or video generator, subscription checkout, or visitor profile database.</p><h2>Technical request data</h2><p>Our hosting and security provider may process standard request data such as IP address, browser type, requested URL, timestamp, and security signals to deliver and protect the site.</p><h2>No roleplay or media collection</h2><p>We do not accept or store Dreemy AI messages, prompts, account credentials, generated media, or private images. Do not send sensitive data through public correction channels.</p><h2>External websites</h2><p>Links to Dreemy AI and other referenced services lead to third-party sites governed by their own privacy terms. Review those policies before registering, chatting, uploading media, or paying.</p><h2>Google Analytics</h2><p>Google Analytics 4 starts automatically when a normal browser opens a page, without an analytics permission button. It measures page visits, scrolling, outbound link clicks, device information and referral sources. Analytics cookies help distinguish visits and are configured to expire after 180 days, subject to renewal when used. Google may process data outside your country. Google signals, advertising personalization and advertising storage are disabled.</p><p>GA4 automatically excludes known bots and spiders. This site also skips analytics for identifiable crawler user agents and browsers that explicitly identify themselves as automated. These filters cannot guarantee detection of every bot that impersonates a human visitor.</p><p>Global Privacy Control, Do Not Track and the Google Analytics opt-out browser setting are respected. Query strings and fragments are omitted from the page URL in our tag configuration, and referral URLs are reduced to their origin. We do not send chat messages, prompts, uploads or contact-form contents to Analytics. Clearing cookies does not erase data already processed by Google.</p><p>Further information: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</p></InfoPage>
